        <activityName xml:lang="en">Warming, warm impact extrusion, steel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Warming, warm impact extrusion, steel
The reference for warming is 1 kg of metal. As there is a large variation from factory to factory with regard to the LCI, it is advised that in case this dataset becomes important in the results, it has to be investigated further if the rough estimations made are applicable or not. ;
UUID: 1f0b381e-76d3-3aec-be03-e029a91a317e
This dataset encompasses the energy consumption for the warming of the steel before it is deformed by impact extrusion. Infrastructure is not included since it is thought that this process is an integral part of the impact extrusion dataset where infrastructure is included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1f0b381e-76d3-3aec-be03-e029a91a317e.xml</text>
